#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file InsertCalendarDialog.ui line 16
#: rc.cpp:3 InsertCalendar.cpp:88
msgid "Insert Calendar"
msgstr "Sititchî calindrî"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file InsertCalendarDialog.ui line 22
#: rc.cpp:6
msgctxt "This what's this help applies for the entire dialog."
msgid ""
"The Insert Calendar dialog lets you set the dates of the calendar you want "
"to insert. When you have chosen the desired dates, simply press the Insert "
"button to insert the calendar into the spreadsheet, starting at the cell you "
"have currently selected."
msgstr ""
"Li purnea d' sitchaedje d' on calindrî vos leye defini les dates do calindrî "
"k' vos vloz stitchî. Cwand vs åroz tchoezi les dates volowes, tchôkîz "
"simplumint li boton Sititchî po stitchî l' calindrî dins l' tåvlea, en "
"atakant dins l' boesse tchoezeye pol moumint."

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file InsertCalendarDialog.ui line 28
#: rc.cpp:9
msgid "Start Date"
msgstr "Date di cominçmint"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file InsertCalendarDialog.ui line 31
#: rc.cpp:12
msgid "Set the start date of the calendar you want to insert"
msgstr "Definixhoz l' date di cmince do calindrî k' vos vloz stitchî"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file InsertCalendarDialog.ui line 34
#: rc.cpp:15
msgid ""
"Here you can choose on which date your calendar should start. The selected "
"date will be the first day of the inserted calendar. You can also choose a "
"date from a calendar dialog by pressing Select Date."
msgstr ""
"Vos ploz tchoezi vaici a kéne date vos vloz k' vosse calindrî comince. Li "
"date tchoezeye serè l' prumî djoû do calindrî stitchî. Vos ploz ossu tchoezi "
"ene date dins on purnea di calindrî e tchôcant Tchoezi date."

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file InsertCalendarDialog.ui line 60
#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file InsertCalendarDialog.ui line 105
#: rc.cpp:18 rc.cpp:33
msgid "Date Picker"
msgstr "Apiceu d' date"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file InsertCalendarDialog.ui line 63
#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file InsertCalendarDialog.ui line 108
#: rc.cpp:21 rc.cpp:36
msgid "Use a graphical date picker to select a date"
msgstr "Si siervi d' on tchoezixheu grafike di date po tchoezi l' date"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file InsertCalendarDialog.ui line 73
#: rc.cpp:24
msgid "End Date"
msgstr "Date di fén"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file InsertCalendarDialog.ui line 76
#: rc.cpp:27
msgid "Set the end date of the calendar you want to insert"
msgstr "Definixhoz l' date di dfén do calindrî k' vos vloz stitchî"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file InsertCalendarDialog.ui line 79
#: rc.cpp:30
msgid ""
"Here you can choose on which date your calendar should end. The selected "
"date will be the last day of the inserted calendar. You can also choose a "
"date from a calendar dialog by pressing Select Date."
msgstr ""
"Vos ploz tchoezi vaici a kéne date vos vloz k' vosse calindrî finixhe. Li "
"date tchoezeye serè l' dierin djoû do calindrî stitchî. Vos ploz ossu "
"tchoezi ene date dins on purnea di calindrî e tchôcant Tchoezi date."

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file InsertCalendarDialog.ui line 142
#: rc.cpp:39
msgid "&Insert"
msgstr "&Sititchî"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file InsertCalendarDialog.ui line 145
#: rc.cpp:42
msgctxt "Tooltip for the insert button of the insert calendar plugin"
msgid "Insert the calendar at the currently selected cell"
msgstr "Sititchî l' calindrî dins l' boesse tchoezeye pol moumint"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file InsertCalendarDialog.ui line 148
#: rc.cpp:45
msgctxt "What's this for the insert button of the insert calendar plugin"
msgid ""
"A new calendar will be inserted starting at the currently selected cell."
msgstr ""
"On novea calindrî va esse sititchî en atacant dins l' boesse tchoezeye pol "
"moumint."

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file InsertCalendarDialog.ui line 163
#: rc.cpp:48
msgid "&Cancel"
msgstr "&Rinoncî"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file InsertCalendarDialog.ui line 166
#: rc.cpp:51
msgid "Do not insert a calendar"
msgstr "Èn nén stitchî on calindrî"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file InsertCalendarDialog.ui line 169
#: rc.cpp:54
msgid ""
"Quits the dialog and does not insert a calendar. Use this to cancel this "
"operation."
msgstr ""
"Cwite li dvize eyet n' sititche pont d' calindrî. Siervoz di çoula po "
"rinoncî a l' operåcion."

#. i18n: tag text
#. i18n: file insertcalendar.rc line 4
#: rc.cpp:57
msgid "&Tools"
msgstr "&Usteyes"

#: rc.cpp:58
msgctxt "NAME OF TRANSLATORS"
msgid "Your names"
msgstr "Djan Cayron"

#: rc.cpp:59
msgctxt "EMAIL OF TRANSLATORS"
msgid "Your emails"
msgstr "jean.cayron@gmail.com"

#: InsertCalendar.cpp:75
msgid "Insert Calendar..."
msgstr "Sititchî calindrî..."

#: InsertCalendar.cpp:90
msgid "KSpread Insert Calendar Plugin"
msgstr "Tchôke-divins po stitchî on calindrî di KSpread"

#: InsertCalendar.cpp:92
msgid "(c) 2005, The KSpread Team"
msgstr "© 2005, L' ekipe di KSpread"

#: InsertCalendar.cpp:95
msgid "Raphael Langerhorst"
msgstr "Raphael Langerhorst"

#: InsertCalendar.cpp:129
msgid "Cannot insert calendar because no document is set!"
msgstr ""
"Dji n' sai stitchî d' calindrî a cåze ki gn a pont d' documint defini !"

#: InsertCalendar.cpp:129 InsertCalendar.cpp:135 InsertCalendar.cpp:141
msgid "Error"
msgstr "Aroke"

#: InsertCalendar.cpp:135
msgid ""
"End date is before start date! Please make sure that end date comes after "
"start date."
msgstr ""
"Li date di fén est dvant l' date di cominçmint !  Waitîz s' i vs plait kel "
"date di fén arive aprè l' cisse di cominçmint."

#: InsertCalendar.cpp:141
msgid ""
"Calendars should not be longer than 10 years. If you really need such long "
"periods you need to split them up."
msgstr ""
"Les calindrîs n' duvrént nén esse pus longs ki 10 anêyes. Si vs avoz vormint "
"dandjî d' on télmint long moumint, i vs fåt l' dispårti e bokets."

#: InsertCalendar.cpp:147
msgid ""
"Start and end dates are equal! Only one day will be inserted, do you want to "
"continue?"
msgstr ""
"Li date di cominçmint eyet d' fén sont ewales ! I gn årè k' on seu djoû d' "
"sititchî, voloz vs continouwer ?"

#: InsertCalendar.cpp:147 InsertCalendar.cpp:153 InsertCalendar.cpp:180
msgid "Warning"
msgstr "Asteme"

#: InsertCalendar.cpp:153
msgid ""
"Creating a calendar for a longer period than a year can take up a lot of "
"space, do you want to continue?"
msgstr ""
"Ahiver on calindrî pos ont moumint pus long k' ene anêye pout prinde bråmint "
"d' plaece, voloz vs continouwer ?"

#: InsertCalendar.cpp:180
msgid ""
"The area where the calendar is inserted is NOT empty, are you sure you want "
"to continue, overwriting existing data? If you choose No the area that would "
"be required for the desired calendar will be selected so you can see what "
"data would be overwritten."
msgstr ""
"Li redjon ewou çki dj' doet stitchî l' calindrî n' est NÉN vude, estoz vs "
"seur di voleur continouwer, sipotchant inla les dnêyes egzistantes ? Si vs "
"tchoezixhoz Neni, li redjon k' ons åreut dandjî pol calindrî volou srè "
"tchoezeye afisse ki vs poloxhe vey kénès dnêyes seront spotcheyes."

#: InsertCalendar.cpp:195
#, kde-format
msgid "Calendar from %1 to %2"
msgstr "Calindrî di %1 a %2"

#: InsertCalendar.cpp:242
msgid "week"
msgstr "samwinne"
